('6e76163c-a4e6-5b48-85da-0bc1b3577151','85c603ae-0cd3-5ecb-98d5-09a6e53f9a4c',1,'In a jug, mix the tahini with the zest and juice of the lemon and 50ml of cold water to make a runny dressing. Season to taste, then set aside.',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00','themealdb-import','themealdb-import',0),
