('4f3cf539-9c85-5603-a623-2a3707617fee','6868e69c-a15e-57dd-a6a3-fa671f50e27d',7,'Roll the remaining pastry out on a lightly floured surface, turning the pastry frequently until around 5mm/¼in thick and 4cm/1½in larger than the pie dish. Lift the pastry over the rolling pin and place it gently into the pie dish. Press the pastry firmly up the sides, making sure there are no air bubbles. Leave the excess pastry overhanging the sides.',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00','themealdb-import','themealdb-import',0),
