('58f185c5-3ce0-548e-babd-802534e96d4d','d4a98deb-e2d1-5767-9d4f-fe013e4bbd64',1,'Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9-inch pie dish.',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00','themealdb-import','themealdb-import',0),
('2da4e5c8-d209-5268-a754-27827dc0322a','d4a98deb-e2d1-5767-9d4f-fe013e4bbd64',2,'Place the brown sugar and butter in a mixing bowl, and beat them together with an electric mixer until creamy and very well combined, without lumps. Beat in eggs, one at a time, incorporating the first egg before adding the next one. Add the vanilla extract and salt; beat the flour in, a little at a time, and then the milk, making a creamy batter. Pour the batter into the prepared pie dish.',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00','themealdb-import','themealdb-import',0),
