('2d988045-6e19-52e2-8e96-397d1f882c08','5977ae8d-2628-526b-ab00-662c6bf13465',1,'Put a sieve over a large bowl, line it with a thick sheet of non-dyed kitchen paper or a clean muslin cloth, and spoon in the yogurt. Cover with another sheet of kitchen paper and leave to strain in the fridge for a minimum of 12 hrs.',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00',timestamp with time zone '2026-10-03 08:00:00+00','themealdb-import','themealdb-import',0),
